# PETAL PARADE: hopping over a bramble leaves it dizzy for a while; landing
# on one without a hop ends the game.
game petalparade
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat put bramble 5 6
wait 21
press A
wait 8
expect state == 1
expect daze_5_6 > 200
wait 30
expect state == 1
cheat clear
cheat put bramble 5 6
wait 30
expect state == 2
